<EADATA version="1.0" exporter="Enterprise Architect"><Dataset_0><Data><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>translation_status</Property><Value>legacy_cache_or_source_fallback_requires_review</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>relationship_semantics</Property><Value>Nesting: generated output grouped under source; not verified deriveReqt or satisfy</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>semantic_support_verified</Property><Value>false</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>mathematical_derivation_verified</Property><Value>false</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>classification_v2</Property><Value>placeholder_deferred</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>shall_zh</Property><Value>海水冷却系统采用主循环泵配置时，应设置低供水报警功能，报警信号应能在驾驶台或主控制站显示，以便操作人员及时启动备用泵或切换至备用泵。</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>evidence_sources</Property><Value>S43 ABS Marine Vessel Rules Part 4 2021; S21 Caterpillar Cooling Systems Application and Installation Guide</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>evidence_tiers</Property><Value>L1; L3</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>evidence_ids</Property><Value>E-HT-ALARM-001; E-PUMP-ALARM-002</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>verification</Property><Value>Test</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>route_reason</Property><Value>value deferred to named source document</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>review_route</Property><Value>OPEN_ITEM</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>derivation</Property><Value>Deferred</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>grade</Property><Value>C</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>criterion</Property><Value>{{TBD|unit:MPa|ref:S43 ABS Marine Vessel Rules Part 4 2021|component:海水冷却系统主循环泵|intent:低供水报警阈值|hint:报警阈值应依据厂家技术数据或项目计算文件确定，不得超出具体厂家、机型和控制系统配置范围}}</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>2</Object_ID><Property>stakeholder</Property><Value>船检</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>2</Object_ID><Property>text_zh</Property><Value>海水冷却系统如果采用主循环泵相关配置，低供水情况要能报警，便于及时启动或切换。</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>text</Property><Value>&lt;memo&gt;</Value><Notes>When the seawater cooling system is configured with a main circulation pump, a low supply alarm function shall be provided. The alarm signal shall be capable of being displayed on the bridge or at the main control station so that operators can promptly start the standby pump or change over to the standby pump.</Notes></Row><Row><Object_ID>3</Object_ID><Property>id</Property><Value>OR041.1</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row><Row><Object_ID>2</Object_ID><Property>text</Property><Value>&lt;memo&gt;</Value><Notes>For the seawater cooling system, if a main circulation pump-related configuration is adopted, a low supply condition must be able to trigger an alarm to facilitate timely startup or changeover.</Notes></Row><Row><Object_ID>2</Object_ID><Property>id</Property><Value>OR041</Value><Notes xmlns:dt="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:datatypes" dt:dt="bin.base64"/></Row></Data></Dataset_0></EADATA>
